			        ),
			        REMOVEFILTERS ( dim_year ),
			        dim_year[year] = y
			    )
			```
		formatString: 0%
		displayFolder: 3 Group
		lineageTag: 833c88a0-fb40-5a6a-9a46-6bf3a68b0bf6

